      "message": "*should* be is the important part: this enforces that! It\u0027s not hard to accidentally do it wrong (example: `apshutdown` currently does it wrong), and the assertion will tell you it\u0027s wrong without any cost in release builds.",
      "parentUuid": "dd852262_9e82c659",
